#ASSERT `Is it an injury` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is it an injury` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is it an injury` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is it an injury` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is it an injury` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `ss 42, 45 -- injury management plan`

-- "more than 7 days": 7 is not; 8 is.
