§§ `s 48A -- return-to-work notices`

-- Notice 1 March 2026: 15 March is 14 days after (allowed), 14 March 13 (not); 30 April is 60 days after (allowed),
-- 1 May 61 (not).
#ASSERT `Is my suspension date allowed` (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 15 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my suspension date allowed` (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 14 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my suspension date allowed` (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 30 4 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my suspension date allowed` (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- Arguments: current work capacity, reasonable efforts, notice given, complied by the date, complied during the
-- suspension, suspension ended, earlier notices without suspension, earlier suspensions.
#ASSERT `What may the insurer do if I do not try to return to work` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 0 0 EQUALS `nothing under section 48A`
#ASSERT `What may the insurer do if I do not try to return to work` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 0 0 EQUALS `nothing under section 48A`
#ASSERT `What may the insurer do if I do not try to return to work` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 EQUALS `give me a written notice first, stating the obligation and a suspension date`
#ASSERT `What may the insurer do if I do not try to return to work` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0 0 EQUALS `nothing under section 48A`
#ASSERT `What may the insurer do if I do not try to return to work` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE 0 0 EQUALS `resume my weekly payments from the day I complied, the suspended payments being forfeited`
#ASSERT `What may the insurer do if I do not try to return to work` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 EQUALS `suspend my weekly payments for 28 days from the date in the notice`
#ASSERT `What may the insurer do if I do not try to return to work` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 0 0 EQUALS `terminate my weekly payments for this injury`
#ASSERT `What may the insurer do if I do not try to return to work` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 0 EQUALS `terminate my weekly payments for this injury`
#ASSERT `What may the insurer do if I do not try to return to work` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 2 0 EQUALS `cease and determine my entitlement to weekly payments for this injury`
#ASSERT `What may the insurer do if I do not try to return to work` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 0 1 EQUALS `cease and determine my entitlement to weekly payments for this injury`

